  "dct_title_s": "Wildebeest Observations: Athi-Kapiti Plains, Kenya, 1977-78 and 1994-96",
  "dct_description_sm": [
    "This polygon shapefile portrays number of wildebeest observed in 1977-78 and 1994-96 in the Athi-Kapiti Plains, Kenya. Note: This data shows numbers of wildebeest observed during the wet season by low-altitude flights. The data was then aggregated to 5km grid cells by number observed.",
    "This data was used in Map 5.15 in Nature's Benefits in Kenya: An Atlas of Ecosystems and Human Well-Being."
  ],
